<title>CROATIA: Croatia Nov currency reserves shrink to $4.32 bln.</title>
<headline>Croatia Nov currency reserves shrink to $4.32 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENCY RESERVES    NOV '96     OCT '96     NOV '95</p>
<p> Total (million USD)	    4,342.7     4,390.3     3,106.0</p>
<p> National Bank of Croatia     2,292.5     2,312.5     1,892.0</p>
<p> Commercial banks		 2,050.2     2,077.8     1,214.0</p>
<p>NOTE -- Commercial banks' November international reserves shrank 1.3 percent from October, with central bank's reserves down 0.9 percent on a monthly level.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
